{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/revised-direction-issued-to-solihull-metropolitan-borough-council-march-2023","content_id":"fb0130c4-1585-413a-93af-9d6812fb8003","description":"Statutory direction issued to Solihull Metropolitan Borough Council in relation to children’s services.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"64133e4a8fa8f555693009e3","filename":"Revised_direction_to_Solihull_Metropolitan_Borough_Council_17_Mar_2023.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":138241,"filename":"Revised_direction_to_Solihull_Metropolitan_Borough_Council_17_Mar_2023.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9282125","isbn":"","number_of_pages":4,"title":"Revised direction issued to Solihull Metropolitan Borough Council in relation to children’s services","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/64133e4a8fa8f555693009e3/Revised_direction_to_Solihull_Metropolitan_Borough_Council_17_Mar_2023.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <p>This statutory direction has been revoked from 30 April 2026 following a <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://files.ofsted.gov.uk/v1/file/50293398\">report by Ofsted</a> published on 12 January 2026.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>This revised direction requires the council to continue to co-operate with the commissioner appointed by the Secretary of State for Education.</p>\n\n<p>It follows:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>an <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/solihull-childrens-services-commissioner-report\">independent report by the Commissioner for Solihull Children Services</a>, Sir Alan Wood</li>\n  <li>an <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://reports.ofsted.gov.uk/provider/44/80554\">Ofsted inspection report of Solihull Metropolitan Borough Council local authority children’s services</a> published 13 January 2023 that judged services to be inadequate</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>This direction replaces the earlier <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/direction-issued-to-solihull-metropolitan-borough-council\">statutory direction</a> issued to the council in November 2022.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"This direction was revoked on 30 April 2026.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-12T15:10:58Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2023-03-17T00:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["ebd15ade-73b2-4eaf-b1c3-43034a42eb37"],"featured_attachments":["9282125"],"first_public_at":"2023-03-17T00:00:00.000+00:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2023-03-17T00:00:00+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/revised-direction-issued-to-solihull-metropolitan-borough-council-march-2023","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/revised-direction-issued-to-solihull-metropolitan-borough-council-march-2023","base_path":"/government/publications/revised-direction-issued-to-solihull-metropolitan-borough-council-march-2023","content_id":"fb0130c4-1585-413a-93af-9d6812fb8003","document_type":"correspondence","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-05-12T15:10:58Z","schema_name":"publication","title":"Revised direction issued to Solihull Metropolitan Borough Council: March 2023","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/revised-direction-issued-to-solihull-metropolitan-borough-council-march-2023","with